step To Orgrimmar
  zone Orgrimmar
  tip From the Crossroads follow the road north-east to Far Watch Post, cross the Southfury River into Durotar and keep north to Orgrimmar's main gate. The next guide starts in Orgrimmar and takes the zeppelin to Tirisfal Glades and Silverpine Forest.
